<section class="py-5 position-relative" style="background-color: #eee;">
   <div class="container px-2 px-sm-0">
      <div class="d-flex">
         <div id="cv" class="carousel slide" data-ride="carousel">

            <!-- Indicators -->
            <ul class="carousel-indicators">
               <li data-target="#cv" data-slide-to="0" class="active"></li>
               <li data-target="#cv" data-slide-to="1"></li>
               <li data-target="#cv" data-slide-to="2"></li>
               <li data-target="#cv" data-slide-to="3"></li>
               <li data-target="#cv" data-slide-to="4"></li>
            </ul>

            <!-- The slideshow -->
            <div class="carousel-inner">
               <div class="carousel-item active">
                  <div class="row d-md-flex align-items-center">
                     <div class="col-md-7">
                        <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/video/1.jpg" class="img-fluid mb-2 w-100" alt=" My Real Estate Journey | Ranjit Naiknavare" data-src="UjDzbdW8XkI">
                        <p class="d-none">My Real Estate Journey | Ranjit Naiknavare | Interview</p>
                     </div>
                     <div class="col-md-5">
                        <span class="text-uppercase text-2 text-brown">My Real Estate Journey | Ranjit Naiknavare | Interview</span>
                        <p>Here's our Director, Mr. Ranjit Naiknavare, in conversation with Mr. Suresh Castellino, National Director at Colliers India. In this interview, Mr. Ranjit takes us through his journey in real estate and how he contributed to building a company which caters to every part of society. Hear him share his milestones, his thoughts on the current real-estate scenario and tips for novices to excel in this industry.</p>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="carousel-item">
                  <div class="row d-md-flex align-items-center">
                     <div class="col-md-7">
                        <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/video/2.jpg" class="img-fluid mb-2 w-100" alt=" Buying Your Dream Home | Hemant Naiknavare | Interview" data-src="Vqs2PDMgOJQ">
                        <p class="d-none">Buying Your Dream Home | Hemant Naiknavare | Interview</p>
                     </div>
                     <div class="col-md-5">
                        <span class="text-uppercase text-2 text-brown">Buying Your Dream Home | Hemant Naiknavare | Interview </span>
                        <p>"Home buying is a science," says our director Mr. Hemant Naiknavare. Here, he explains how one goes about the process of purchasing a house; right from deciding on a location, choosing a developer to finalizing the price & the amenities.</p>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="carousel-item">
                  <div class="row d-md-flex align-items-center">
                     <div class="col-md-7">
                        <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/video/line-video-thumbnail.webp" class="img-fluid mb-2 w-100" alt="The Pioneers Of ALU-FORM Technology " data-src="7786VvI-irk">
                        <p class="d-none">A Legacy Built with Purpose</p>
                     </div>
                     <div class="col-md-5">
                        <span class="text-uppercase text-2 text-brown"> A Legacy Built with Purpose </span>
                        <p>At Naiknavare Developers, we evolve with the cities we shape. From homes and commercial spaces to senior living,
                           redevelopment and hospitality each vertical reflects our commitment to purposeful development. Diverse offerings,
                           unified by one philosophy: building responsibly for today and generations to come.</p>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="carousel-item">
                  <div class="row d-md-flex align-items-center">
                     <div class="col-md-7">
                        <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/video/4.jpg" class="img-fluid mb-2 w-100" alt="Ms. Gauri Naiknavare's Take On Women's Day " data-src="iosDAJ0Q32Q">
                        <p class="d-none">Ms. Gauri Naiknavare's take on Women's day</p>
                     </div>
                     <div class="col-md-5">
                        <span class="text-uppercase text-2 text-brown"> Ms. Gauri Naiknavare's take on Women's day</span>
                        <p>Here's a woman with big dreams, wishing everyone a very Happy Women's Day. Through this video, Ms. Gauri Naiknavare shares with us how she achieved her dreams and how you can too.
                        </p>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>
               <div class="carousel-item">
                  <div class="row d-md-flex align-items-center">
                     <div class="col-md-7">
                        <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/video/5.jpg" class="img-fluid mb-2 w-100" alt=" Prioritising Slum - Rehabilation " data-src="3oPBKmIgjvo">
                        <p class="d-none">Prioritising slum-rehabilitation1</p>
                     </div>
                     <div class="col-md-5">
                        <span class="text-uppercase text-2 text-brown">Prioritising slum-rehabilitation</span>
                        <p>An increase in the number of slum dwellers negatively affects the overall development of a city. To keep up with our motto and contribute towards 'better living for all', we have taken the next step to improve this section of our society.</p>
                        <p>With our slum rehabilitation projects, we offer slum dwellers with healthier living and inculcate a sense of hygiene, cleanliness and discipline. We believe, once the economically weaker section of the society develops, it leads to social upliftment, civilised living and a slum-free city. Watch this video to learn about our milestones and achievements while providing over 10000 families with their dream homes.
                        </p>

                     </div>
                  </div>
               </div>


               <!--  <div class="carousel-item">
                     <div class="row d-md-flex align-items-center">
                        <div class="col-md-7">
               <img src="https://naiknavare.com/assets/img/brand-video-home-sk7g-_FXh84F-1280x720.webp" class="img-fluid mb-2 w-100" alt="Naiknavare | Build on Value, Tested Overtime " data-src="iosDAJ0Q32Q">
               <p class="d-none">Naiknavare | Build on Value, Tested Overtime</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-5">
                     <span class="text-uppercase text-2 text-brown"> Naiknavare | Build on Value, Tested Overtime</span>
                           <p>Witness the dedication of Naiknavare Developers to evolve with the times, embracing new ideas while upholding the values that have been ingrained. Join us on a journey through our legacy of over 38 years, where we've evolved and adapted to the ever-shifting landscape of real estate.
               </p>
                        
                  </div>
                     </div>
                  </div>  -->



            </div>

            <!-- Left and right controls -->
